  "slug": "a-beautiful-word",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/4312_a-beautiful-word.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "There is a girl named Kelly at Oxford University. Before going to college, she had always been a good student, but after arriving at Oxford, she became the worst student in the class. In fact, it's not that Kelly isn't smart or doesn't work hard, it's that she has too low self-esteem.",
    "One day, Kelly was in class, and someone walked into the classroom and said that he wanted to find the most beautiful girl in the class to be the image spokesperson of their company. The man looked at the students in the classroom, and finally pointed at Kelly and said, \"That's her. She is the most beautiful girl in my eyes.\"",
    "In fact, this person was found by Kelly's father to help Kelly regain her confidence. From then on, Kelly gained confidence again and became an excellent student."
  ],
  "english_full": "There is a girl named Kelly at Oxford University. Before going to college, she had always been a good student, but after arriving at Oxford, she became the worst student in the class. In fact, it's not that Kelly isn't smart or doesn't work hard, it's that she has too low self-esteem.\n\nOne day, Kelly was in class, and someone walked into the classroom and said that he wanted to find the most beautiful girl in the class to be the image spokesperson of their company. The man looked at the students in the classroom, and finally pointed at Kelly and said, \"That's her. She is the most beautiful girl in my eyes.\"\n\nIn fact, this person was found by Kelly's father to help Kelly regain her confidence. From then on, Kelly gained confidence again and became an excellent student.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Есть де́вушка по и́мени Келли в О́ксфордском университе́те. Ра́нее, прежде чем по́йти в ко́лледж, она всегда́ была хоро́шей студе́нткой, но по́сле прибытия в О́ксфорд она стала ху́дшей студе́нткой в классе. На де́ле, не то чтобы Келли не была умно́й или не рабо́тала тяжело́, но у неё сли́шком ни́зкая самооце́нка.",
    "Одна́жды Келли была в классе, и кто́-то зашёл в кла́ссную ко́мнату и ска́зал, что он хо́чет найти наи́красивую де́вушку в классе, чтобы она стала представи́тельницей имиджа их компа́нии. Дя́дя посмотре́л на студе́нтов в кла́ссной и, наконе́ц, указал на Келли и ска́зал: \"Э́та. Она наи́красивейшая де́вушка в моих гла́зах.\"",
    "На де́ле, э́того челове́ка нашёл ба́тька Келли, чтобы помо́чь Келли вернуть свою уве́ренность. С тех пор Келли снова при́обрела уве́ренность и стала отли́чной студе́нткой."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Yest dévushka po ímeni Kellí v Óksforskom universiteté. Ránee, prézhde chem póyti v kólledzh, ona vsegdá byla horóshay studéntkoy, no pósle pribýtiya v Óksford ona stála khúdshey studéntkoy v klásse. Na déle, ne to chtoby Kellí ne byla umnóy ili ne rabótala tyazheló, no u ney slíshkom nízkaya samootsénka.",
    "Odnázhdy Kellí byla v klásse, i któ-to zashól v klásnuyu kómnatu i skázal, chto on khóchet nayti naikrasívuyu dévushku v klásse, chtoby ona stala predstavitelnitséy imídzha ikh kompánii. Dyádi posmotrel na studéntov v klásnoy i, nakonéts, ukázal na Kellí i skázal: \"Éta. Ona naikrasívayshaya dévushka v moikh glázakh.\"",
    "Na déle, étogo cheloviéka nashól bátyka Kellí, chtoby pomóch' Kellí vernut' svoyu uverennost'. S tékh por Kellí snová priyóbrala uverennost' i stála otlíchnoy studéntkoy."
  ],
